/* =====================================================================
   MarketLink data export - INSERT ONLY (no table structure)
   Source database: MarketDB, exported 2026-09-26 23:47

   - Never deletes or changes rows that are already in your database.
   - New rows get new ids from your database; foreign keys are linked again
     through a mapping table, so the data stays consistent.
   - Rows that already exist are reused instead of added twice (matched by
     email/phone, market name, stall code, product name, codes, ...).
   - If an order code is already used by one of your own orders, the
     imported order gets another code (e.g. ML-260926-X27).
   - Safe to run again: the second run adds nothing.
   - Everything runs in one transaction: if something fails, nothing changes.

   Before running: your MarketDB must already have the latest structure
   (Database/MarketLink.sql or Database/Update_ALL_safe_to_rerun.sql, and
   Database/AddFavoriteFarmers.sql for favorite farmers).
   Demo accounts (@demo.marketlink.vn) use the password Test@123.
   ===================================================================== */

